# Ness's PP meter drops a frame later in the emu right after the menu-close lag stretch (289-295),
# where the HP/PP roller's FRAME_COUNTER phase crosses lag-merged frames (1 frame, harness)
# ignore: party
flag 11 1; teleport 4000 9300 6; wait 10; until idle 300
